 marine lubricant, and grease. The company offers its products through e-commerce sales platform. The company was founded in 2010 and is based in Port Klang, Malaysia. PSP Energy Berhad operates as a subsidiary of CS Hutchison Holdings Sdn Bhd.","zh":"PSP Energy Berhad 是一家马来西亚公司，从事燃料和润滑油产品的贸易与分销，成立于2010年，总部位于巴生港，是 CS Hutchison Holdings Sdn Bhd 的子公司。","lines":["燃料产品贸易：从事柴油、燃料油、汽油、煤油和船用柴油等燃料产品的贸易。","燃料产品分销：分销柴油、燃料油、汽油、煤油和船用柴油等燃料产品。","润滑油产品分销：分销柴油发动机油、液压油、齿轮油、船用润滑油和润滑脂等润滑油产品。","电商平台：通过电子商务销售平台提供产品。"],"lines_en":["Trading of Fuel Products: Trading of fuel products including diesel, fuel oil, petrol, kerosene, and marine gas oil.","Distribution of Fuel Products: Distribution of fuel products including diesel, fuel oil, petrol, kerosene, and marine gas oil.","Distribution of Lubricant Products: Distribution of lubricant products including diesel engine oil, hydraulic oil, gear oil, marine lubricant, and grease.","E-commerce Platform: Offering products through an e-commerce sales platform."]}}